WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:13.020
Whas crackin yall? This week we
gettin CRAZY scurred with At the Mountains

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.220
of Madness by HP Lovecraft.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.780
William Dyer bout to sh** a brick, man. Fool
hear a bunch of scientists bouncing over to

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:27.920
Antarctica even though he told em they best
not. And now Dyer gonna give us the low down

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.180
on the da crazy things he saw over there that
left skid marks in his tighty whities.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.290
A while back, Billy D led a crew called the
Miskatonic University Expedition to a shady

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:42.930
part of cold- as-a-b*** Antarctica. A smaller
gang led by his homie Lake go on ahead and

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:48.690
scope some tripped-out fossils hidden in a
swoel mountain range. And these bad boys WAY

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.920
too old to be so evolved.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.590
When Dyer and his posse don’t hear
from Lake, they swang over to his spot to

00:00:54.590 --> 00:01:00.190
see what’s what. Turns out, most of da hoods
in Lake’s click DEAD! Not only dat, but

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:03.440
some of dem aliens fossils dun peaced out!

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:07.880
So Dyer and his boy Danforth get up
on their G-Fo and flow over to the mountains

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:13.459
when they realize “hold up. These aint just
mountains. These be walls hidin’ an ancient

00:01:13.459 --> 00:01:18.860
alien city! Oh snap!” And since Dyer and
Danforth got a hard-on for learning, they

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:21.149
drop down to check dem freaky streets.

00:01:21.149 --> 00:01:25.140
Fools peep some ancient murals
layin down the raw truth bout dem fossils,

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.700
which actually be called “Elder Things.”
Back in the day, these Elder Things landed

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:34.670
their crusty asses on the planet, and created
life on earth. To help em trick out da streets

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:39.399
they livin in, these cats create some G-ed
up hustlaz called “Shoggoths,” who later

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:43.920
stopped takin orders and straight WRECKED
them Elder playas. But things got even more

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:49.459
cray for the Elder Things, cuz the murals
also jivin bout some EPIC GNARLY monster chillin

00:01:49.459 --> 00:01:51.759
in the mountains past the city.

00:01:51.759 --> 00:01:55.890
Later, when our boys crawlin through a dank
tunnel they find in the city, a big fugly

00:01:55.890 --> 00:02:01.619
Shoggoth gets all in their grills and our
boys like “Oh sh**! BREAK YO SELF” And

00:02:01.619 --> 00:02:03.130
bust ass outta there.

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:07.569
Back in the jet, Danforth looks
down past the mountains and sees somethin

00:02:07.569 --> 00:02:12.489
so damn cray that his mind immediately goes
to s***.

00:02:12.489 --> 00:02:17.079
Back home with both his nuts in
tact, Dyer say, look son. Dem scientists best

00:02:17.079 --> 00:02:21.699
check themselves befo deciding to go to Antarctica.
Cuz them mountains ain’t hidin nothin but

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.900
madness. Naw mean?

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:31.769
One thing you gotz to know bout
Lovecraft’s flow is dat he always slangin

00:02:31.769 --> 00:02:36.569
MAD adjectives in his texts to create dat
atmosphere 
of horror. Check it-

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:56.310
That’s double digit adjectives in one damn

00:02:56.739 --> 00:03:02.709
sentence man! See, Lovecraft ain’t interested
in just layin down the plot. Naw blood. Settin

00:03:02.709 --> 00:03:07.980
the mood is way more important. After all,
every playa know you gotta warm the oven before

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:11.930
you slide in the meat. LOVE CRAFT. Naw mean?

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:17.170
As scurry as things be, Lovecraft
keeps rampin it UP. Erry time we meet some

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:23.450
scary-ass alien, ol HP drops an even creepier
alien on our asses. Then eventually he start

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:29.890
jivin bout the ultimate badass beastie that
makes all the other aliens shit their pants!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:30.409
Relentless!

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:34.310
And the scariest thing bout the
Elder Things, Shoggoths, and the ultimate

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:39.209
badass is that human knowledge can’t make
a damn bit of sense of them. Check how Billy

00:03:39.209 --> 00:03:42.669
D talk bout dem Shoggoths:

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:03.870
See man always tryin to categorize
things in order to understand em, but there

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:07.650
are some things that ain’t no amount of
reasoning can make sense of. And that’s

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.819
freaky as hell to think about man!

00:04:09.819 --> 00:04:13.499
But despite dat, the scientists, the aliens,
and even the reader,

00:04:13.499 --> 00:04:18.769
don’t quit when they faced with da whack-ass
unknown. Like a dope fiend, just a lil taste

00:04:18.769 --> 00:04:24.440
of curiosity ain’t enough. Naw, the mo curious
they get, the more they jonezin for a bigger

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:28.370
hit. And maybe that’s the scariest thing
of all- we all gonna keep pushing forward

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:32.780
toward da unknown even when the consequences
can mess sh** up FO REAL.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:56.650
Curiosity might not have killed
those cats, but it sho made one of em mad.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.000
And if you’re curious bout my other
shows, hit dat subscribe and be sure to check

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:04.780
em out. Catch you later. Peace.

